  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A special camera is used for underwater ocean research. The camera is at a depth of <math alttext=\"39\"><mn>39</mn>\n</math> fathoms. What is the camera's depth in <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">feet</span>? <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 fathom  equals 6 feet right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>fathom</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>feet</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
